    "excerpt": "<p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Juicebox is an all vinyl monthly dance party on the fourth Saturday of every month. Running for 10 years, hosts DjBabs and DjTweed spin Indie Sleaze-Post Punk-New Wave-Synthpop-Britpop<br>You’ll hear:<br>The Strokes, David Bowie, Pulp, LCD Soundsystem, Bloc Party, Wet Leg, Cold Cave, The Human League, Joy Division, The Buzzcocks, ABC, Air, The Specials, Le Tigre, Belle &amp; Sebastian, Supergrass, The Clash, Blur, Roxy Music, The Modern Lovers, Orange Juice, Gorillaz, Scissor Sisters, Broadcast, Sextile, Amyl &amp; The Sniffers, Franz Ferdinand, Ladytron, The Drums, Robyn, The Charlatans, CSS, Goldfrapp, The Undertones, The Ramones, The Sounds, Super Furry Animals, St. Etienne, Tahiti 80, Weezer, MIA, Santogold, Garbage, Fatboy Slim, Belle &amp; Sebastian, Wet Leg, Interpol, Madness, Phoenix, Arcade Fire, Happy Mondays, MGMT, The Stone Roses, The Cure, Kasabian, Cut Copy, The Gossip, Automatic, Peaches, The Rapture, Blondie, The Jam, The Dandy Warhols,The Jesus And Mary Chain, Arctic Monkeys, Yacht, Royksopp, Midnight Juggernauts, Tame Impala, The Killers, Viagra Boys, Stereolab, Jet, The Smiths, Sleaford Mods, Simple Minds, New Order and so on...</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">10pm 19+ $10 b4 11 - $15 after</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\" class=\"x1i10hfl xjbqb8w x1ejq31n x18oe1m7 x1sy0etr xstzfhl x972fbf x10w94by x1qhh985 x14e42zd x9f619 x1ypdohk xt0psk2 x3ct3a4 xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl x16tdsg8 x1hl2dhg xggy1nq x1a2a7pz xkrqix3 x1sur9pj x1fey0fg x1s688f\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/juice_times_event?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExc1hBZmxzd0F0a2xTR1dld3NydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR6CA3QwLDWhIw1w-h0xbxKZEk3tGxKdwOiNe0JMNJyhck3lfIxGsODqDlYgOA_aem_3tlN5KEiUapU5uNr_xqV9Q\">https://www.instagram.com/ju