    "title": "Freef'All Open Mic Farewell",
    "excerpt": "<p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Ready to make history? Join Freef'all for our final unforgettable night at the Piston before we move to the Pilot in July. Let’s celebrate the Piston, which we love, with a big send-off party! Bring your songs, bring your friends and let’s make some magic together. As always, admission is free. Doors and sign-ups open at 7pm, and spots are available on a first-come, first-served basis. Our feature will play a half-hour set at 7:30pm, then the open mic kicks off at 8pm. Each performer can play one or two songs. We’ll have amps, drums, keys, house instruments, and a sound engineer ready for you. Musicians of all styles and skill levels are welcome. Hope to see you there!</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/events/1349560007270299/\">https://www.facebook.com/events/1349560007270299/</a> </p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/freefallsundays/\">https://www.instagram.com/freefallsundays/</a></p>",
