    "title": "LOSE YOURSELF Y2K VIDEO DANCE PARTY! ",
    "excerpt": "<p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">On Saturday June 6th, join VJs Mikey Lukey and General Eclectic at The Piston, 937 Bloor Street West in Toronto, Ontario, Canada, to \"Lose Yourself\" to the sounds of the first decade of the millennium, the 2000's, The Naughty Noughties, Y2K baby!<br>From Akon to Alicia keys, Beyonce to Bloc Party, !!! (Chk Chk Chk) to Crazy Town, Daft Punk to Derulo, Fergie to Furtado, Gorillaz to Gwen Stefani, Metric to Maroon 5, Sean Kingston to Sean Paul, The Rapture to The Strokes, T-Pain to Timbaland, White Stripes to Lil Wayne &amp; much more!</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">You only get one shot, do not miss your chance to blow<br>This opportunity comes on the first Saturday of every month!!!</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\" class=\"x1i10hfl xjbqb8w x1ejq31n x18oe1m7 x1sy0etr xstzfhl x972fbf x10w94by x1qhh985 x14e42zd x9f619 x1ypdohk xt0psk2 x3ct3a4 xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl x16tdsg8 x1hl2dhg xggy1nq x1a2a7pz xkrqix3 x1sur9pj x1fey0fg x1s688f\" href=\"https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.instagram.com%2Floseyourselfy2k%3Ffbclid%3DIwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExc3FBYnZGMEVSMDdrUlczc3NydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR71TCXF3iohLPc4oAD1MZU2pbzYVloonweLtAcyDxsZxBF4PKtC2TF8zf2gig_aem_1-Kq5zY-ij1OSF4lfPJxTg&amp;h=AUBesT1aA881AU0YTKSdC5yjvt3z-TnVBQazcWBIoj72LLLMRBSMk3x-_MhJNN89j4wBNGZ8cA4_r5RFGFZ1AhysnMDak2laWl2JGcRRasQ5Y2YJSsY3EVcqrInRaRyj36kLeuY4m3nc1dC9ekzDTOrNKIjGLXtlUW0&amp;__tn__=q&amp;c[0]=AUCdOb2dsNNdNtZjQ-RFaizs9ql85Hpax98zL3bXScU8XAUfe0ZGQUZdvA_7ATI0XnDBzu8zYBYiCEiqoy2bjRG_HO5vM0C_N3mbj7f_PJ5ddLwhx38mZotw4LJcvsKyWSwDPmm8OUY3WY9gjFVIw_Fqg8mYS2s7KgI\">https://www.instagram.com/loseyourselfy2k</a> </p>",
