    "excerpt": "<p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Wax Candy is Toronto’s Friday night Disco party! Resident DJ Cyclist serves up the sweetest soulful and uplifting club classics and unearthed Disco gems how they are meant to heard, on vinyl and in one of the best sounding rooms in the Toronto. Thank God It’s Friday, let loose and get your dance on!</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><br>A warm welcome from Cynthia at the door and go find your friends on the dance floor.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Doors 10pm free b4 11pm $10 after - 19+</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/waxcandydisco/\">https://www.instagram.com/waxcandydisco/</a> </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/torontodisco\">https://www.facebook.com/torontodisco</a> </p>",
